her look at the demo and realized…There’s still…SO. MUCH. STUFF. LEFT. TO DO!! w(ﾟДﾟ)wDo it all!! OVERTIME!!!(A 360° spiraling, in-place scream powered by Magdeburg hemispheres, KFC theory, and absolutely zero blind spot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T07:55:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691456","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952700-1842846814441976","game_id":"steam-4952700","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Log #02","summary":"It’s been over two weeks since our last devlog.We spent almost the entire first week wrestling with the script. The director, writers, artists, and programmers pulled several all-nighters in a row, going through the plot scene by scene and tweaking the dialogue line by line.We won't bother counting exactly how many sleepless nights that took. The good news is that the new script is officially finalized!The story is divided into six chapters; Chapter 1 is currently about 80% complete, and the fil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T02:12:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441976","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952700-1841579228661814","game_id":"steam-4952700","kind":"announcement","title":"LIMINAL: Within Developer Diary","summary":"This is the first developer diary for Thriller Paradise: LIMINAL: Within.We spent a long time thinking about where to begin. In the end, we decided the best place to start was by being honest about where the project stands today.The Steam store page currently online, our first trailer, and the playable demo we completed internally all represent an earlier iteration of the project. 